hadiths[30]{hadithnumber,text}:
"105201","Yahya related to me from Malik, from Ibn Shihab, from Humayd ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf, from Abu Hurayrah, that the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, said, \Whoever spends a pair in the way of Allah will be called from the gate of Paradise"," saying"," 'O servant of Allah"," this is better.' Whoever is from the people of prayer will be called from the gate of prayer"," and whoever is from the people of jihad will be called from the gate of jihad"," and whoever is from the people of charity will be called from the gate of charity"," and whoever is from the people of fasting will be called from the gate of Ar-Rayyan.\"" Abu Bakr as-Siddiq said"," \""O Messenger of Allah"," there is no harm for one who is called from these gates. Will anyone be called from all of these gates?\"" He said"," \""Yes"," and I hope you will be among them.\"""""
"105202","Yahya narrated to me from Malik, from Yazid ibn Abdillah ibn Qusayt, from Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Thaban, from his mother, from A'ishah, the wife of the Prophet ﷺ, that the Messenger of Allah ﷺ commanded that the skins of carrion be made use of if they are tanned."
"105301","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad disapproved of eating game that had been killed with throwing sticks and by clay pellets"
"105302","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad disapproved of eating game that had been killed with throwing sticks and by clay pellets"
"105401","[1054] And he told me on the authority of Malik, on the authority of Ja’far ibn Muhammad, on the authority of his father, that he said: Fatima, the daughter of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, committed poetry. Hasan, Hussein, Zainab, and Umm Kulthum, so she gave the weight of that in silver in charity. \\nMutta Imam Malik Hadith: 1054 Arabic Hadith:"
"105402","[1054] And he told me on the authority of Malik, on the authority of Ja’far ibn Muhammad, on the authority of his father, that he said: Fatima, the daughter of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, committed poetry. Hasan, Hussein, Zainab, and Umm Kulthum, so she gave the weight of that in silver in charity. \\nMutta Imam Malik Hadith: 1054 Arabic Hadith:"
"105501","[1055] And he told me on the authority of Malik, on the authority of Rabi’a bin Abi Abd al-Rahman, on the authority of Muhammad bin Ali bin al-Hussein, that he said: She committed adultery. Fatimah, the daughter of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, had the hair of Hasan and Hussein, so she gave in charity her zina in silver, laid out in front of Malik Hadith: 1055 Arabic Hadith:"
"105502","[1055] And he told me on the authority of Malik, on the authority of Rabi’a bin Abi Abd al-Rahman, on the authority of Muhammad bin Ali bin al-Hussein, that he said: She committed adultery. Fatimah, the daughter of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, had the hair of Hasan and Hussein, so she gave in charity her zina in silver, laid out in front of Malik Hadith: 1055 Arabic Hadith:"
"105601","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard Nafi say that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"105602","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard Nafi say that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"105701","[1057] And he told me on the authority of Malik, on the authority of Rabi’a bin Abi Abd al-Rahman, on the authority of Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin al-Harith al-Taymi, He said: I heard my father say: Aqeeqah is desirable, even if it is a bird. \\nMutta Imam Malik Hadith: 1057 Arabic Hadith:"
"105702","[1057] And he told me on the authority of Malik, on the authority of Rabi’a bin Abi Abd al-Rahman, on the authority of Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin al-Harith al-Taymi, He said: I heard my father say: Aqeeqah is desirable, even if it is a bird. \\nMutta Imam Malik Hadith: 1057 Arabic Hadith:"
"105801","[1058] And he told me on the authority of Malik that he had learned that he had performed the aqiqah on behalf of Hasan and Hussein, the sons of Ali bin Abi Talib. \\nMutta Imam Malik Hadith: 1058 Arabic Hadith:"
"105802","[1058] And he told me on the authority of Malik that he had learned that he had performed the aqiqah on behalf of Hasan and Hussein, the sons of Ali bin Abi Talib. \\nMutta Imam Malik Hadith: 1058 Arabic Hadith:"
"105901","Yahya related to me from Malik that Urwa ibn Udhayna al-Laythi
said, ""I went out with my grandmother who had vowed to walk to the
House of Allah. When we had gone part of the way, she could not go on.
I sent one of her mawlas to question Abdullah ibn Umar and I went with
him. He asked Abdullah ibn Umar, and Abdullah ibn Umar said to him,
'Take her and let her ride, and when she has the strength let her ride
back, and start to walk from the place from which she was unable to go
on.'~


Yahya said that he had heard Malik say, ""I think that
she must sacrifice an animal.""


Yahya related to me from Malik
that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab and Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-
Rahman said the same as Abdullah ibn Umar."
"105902","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Sad al- Jari"
"106001","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman from Abu Hurayra and Zayd ibn Thabit that they saw no harm in eating what was cast up by the sea"
"106002","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman from Abu Hurayra and Zayd ibn Thabit that they saw no harm in eating what was cast up by the sea"
"106101","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman that some people from al-Jar came to Marwan ibn al- Hakam and asked him about eating what was cast up by the sea. He said"
"106102","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman that some people from al-Jar came to Marwan ibn al- Hakam and asked him about eating what was cast up by the sea. He said"
"106201","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shibab from Abu Idris al- Khawlani from Abu Tha~laba al-Khushani that the Messenger of Allah"
"106202","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shibab from Abu Idris al- Khawlani from Abu Tha~laba al-Khushani that the Messenger of Allah"
"106301","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ismail ibn Abi Hakim from Abiyda ibn Sufyan al-Hadrami from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"106302","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ismail ibn Abi Hakim from Abiyda ibn Sufyan al-Hadrami from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"106401","Yahya related to me from Malik that the best of what he had heard about horses"
"106402","Yahya related to me from Malik that the best of what he had heard about horses"
"106501","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ibn Wala al-Misri from Abdullah ibn Abbas that the Messenger of Allah"
"106502","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ibn Wala al-Misri from Abdullah ibn Abbas that the Messenger of Allah"
"106601","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt from Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Thawban from his mother that A'isha"
"106602","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt from Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Thawban from his mother that A'isha"
